# CQ4 – Which artists were still living when Tate published the data (October 2014)?
PREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>
PREFIX ont:    <https://w3id.org/FAIR-course-UT/2025-2026/group3/ont#>
SELECT ?artist ?name ?birth WHERE {
  ?artist ont:livingAtSnapshot true ;
          schema:name ?name .
  OPTIONAL { ?artist schema:birthDate ?birth }
}
ORDER BY ?name
